<<~ ahu #/head>>

! Train X ~ two hearths

!! Contents

* [[Ground and crew|#/ground]] · [[Commit walk|#/walk]] · [[Witness and driver contract|#/witness]] · [[Collision sheet|#/collisions]] · [[Done when|#/done]] · [[Rulings|#/rulings]].

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/ground>>

!! Ground and crew

Start the automated witness after N, W, O1, sealed-store step 3, H, E, browser custody and Harbor reach their live gates. One witness lead owns the driver and runbook. The operator owns the two-machine ceremony and every real home move. The driver starts two vessels from one image digest with separate roots, volumes, custody and signing handles. Its courier carries files alone. No test touches a real home.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/walk>>

!! Commit walk

# ''PURE: scenario contract.'' Name both roots, image digest, seed cards, file courier and expected observations. The harness refuses shared writable volumes, shared private seeds and a network shortcut through the courier. The node's readback, not a fixture claim, decides each observation.
# ''LIVE: fresh joint start.'' Found two distinct seeds. Read each cold card back. Open, join and seal one 2-of-2 inception through files. Each root independently derives the same joint AID and keeps its seed. Each founder enters the other's gate under its own admitted face.
# ''LIVE: crossing and restart.'' Exchange two self-contracts by partial and cosign. Create a shared realm. Edit from A to B and from B to A. Restart and unlock both roots; read both edits from each root. Add a third root as a seat, contract it as a carrier, and prove its separate key custody. Wake a dormant root, import verified lineage and present its admit.
# ''LIVE: browser and rehearsal.'' Wear a face in a browser tab, cross the same verified gate and read a peer's edit. Run a synthetic-name dress rehearsal. The operator then follows the line-by-line ceremony, reads each fingerprint and AID aloud, scans phones and places cards in two places.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/witness>>

!! Witness and driver contract

The driver reports separate root and image evidence, both seed fingerprints, one final AID, each founder's admitted gate verdict, both directional edits after both restarts, the third seat and carrier contract, dormant import and browser crossing. A missing driver reports no result; it never counts as a red law. Keep the two-direction restart readback in this driver contract until the driver can call real nodes; no unbuilt-laws red stands for it. The witness records every readback and refusal under the node's own output.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/collisions>>

!! Collision sheet

| Seam | X hand-off |
|---|---|
| N | Consume cofounding, partial acts, contracts and final AID; edit no charter composer. |
| W | Consume face gates, file transport and two-Nexus routing; edit no socket sorter. |
| S8 and sealed-store step 3 | Consume sealed custody and authenticated restart; edit no selves rows or Repo format. |
| O1 | Consume scoped node and browser sessions, working addresses and receipts; edit no surface composer. |
| H and E | Consume delegated hosting, answer, public-half grant and serving gate; edit no hosting act or ember arm. |
| Browser and Harbor | Consume custody, HTTPS and discovery; the operator measures the real LAN and phones. |

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/done>>

!! Done when

Two isolated vessels from one image digest keep separate seeds and private handles, hold one fresh joint AID, admit each founder at the other's gate, and read both edits after each restart and unlock. A third seat and carrier contract pass. A dormant root imports lineage and presents its admit. A browser face crosses. The synthetic rehearsal and the operator's line-by-line ceremony each record their own readbacks.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/rulings>>

!! Rulings

The roadmap's TWO HEARTHS path and fresh-start instructions hold the driver and ceremony (<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road#/the-road">>; <<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road#/fresh-start">>). The operator moves old homes aside by hand and keeps them reversible. Recovery contact threshold and succession remain with the operator at `#/open`; X supplies no answer (<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road#/open">>).

<<~/ahu>>

